      "created_at": "2015-01-10T01:21:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They do not, because they will leave play when they take that damage, interrupting the response to that damage, so the response never happens. &nbsp;It works just like damage does, it is trying to complete its effect but fails because it leaves play.</p>",
