      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The original ones had wording that they triggered when damaged or destroyed that got removed becaue it unbalanced his deck. &nbsp;The action the construct would take is interrupted by the HP = 0 or less, and it is removed from play, once removed from play the effect stops because the text is no longer in play.</p>",
