      "created_at": "2015-01-28T04:48:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How about:</p><p>\n&gt; Play this card next to a hero character card.</p><p>Whenever this card is dealt damage, even if that damage destroys it, that hero may use a power.\n</p><p>It's a bit fiddly, but it's pretty clear how it's supposed to be handled.</p>",
